<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA ALL OUT FOR 227 AT DAY ONE CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA ALL OUT FOR 227 AT DAY ONE CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were all out at 227 against South Africa at the close of the first day's play in the third and final cricket test match at Centurion Park on Friday.</p>
</text>
